                                "sense_id": "1f6e690c-375c-31c8-98d2-57e317659cb9",
                                "text": "Some oils which are frequently winterized to produce salad oil are: refined and lightly hydrogenated soybean oil, cottonseed oil and some varieties of rapeseed oil.\nThe continuous miscella winterizing process takes from 45 min to 1 hr to produce +15 hr cold test oil."
                            }
                        ]
